## Acceptance Criteria Mapping

| Criterion | Implementation |
|---|---|
| **Bucket**: versioning, encryption, no public access | `s3.tf` — `aws_s3_bucket_versioning`, `AES256` SSE, `aws_s3_bucket_public_access_block` all `true` |
| **RDS**: deletion protection, backup ≥ 7d, not public | `rds.tf` — `deletion_protection = true`, `backup_retention_period = 7/14`, `publicly_accessible = false` |
| **Secret**: never plaintext in Git | SOPS-encrypted `.enc.yaml` files; `sops_file` data source decrypts at plan time |
| **IAM**: least privilege, no wildcards on prod | `iam.tf` — prod policy has only `GetObject`/`PutObject`/`ListBucket` on specific bucket ARN |
| **Cluster**: managed node groups, correct sizing | `eks.tf` — `aws_eks_node_group` with `instance_types` and `node_count` from `local.environments` |
| **HTTPS**: 443 listener, valid cert | `https.tf` — CloudFront with ACM cert, `viewer_protocol_policy = "https-only"` |
| **Environment isolation** | `for_each` creates independent module instances; changing `prod` values in `local.environments` only affects `module.environment["prod"]` |
